mission "A House Above the Reefs"
    name "A House Above the Reefs"
    description "Carry the convoy manifests to Clerk Mateo at Puerto Cielo and help him secure the archive."
    source "Mariner's Rest"
    destination "Puerto Cielo"
    reward 570
    speaker offer "Captain Ines Calderon"
    speaker visit "Captain Ines Calderon"
    speaker complete "Captain Ines Calderon"
    to offer
        has "The Cormorant Convoy: done"
    on offer
        conversation
            `The convoy manifests identify a Company storehouse above the reefs at Puerto Cielo.`
            `The harbour clerk has been ordered to destroy the old shipping records. He has sent a private request for help before the papers are burned.`
            `The storehouse is guarded, but the original orders are hidden in the customs archive rather than the warehouse.`
            choice
                `(I will take this voyage. Tell me the course.)`
                    goto accept_job
                `(What makes this business so important?)`
                    goto more_details
                `(I have other waters to sail.)`
                    goto decline_job
            label more_details
                `The storehouse is guarded, but the original orders are hidden in the customs archive rather than the warehouse.`
                choice
                    `(Then I will see it done.)`
                        goto accept_job
                    `(Not this time.)`
                        goto decline_job
            label accept_job
                `The freed captains hand over their manifests. One asks you to remember that the cargo was ordinary food and medicine, not a king's treasure.`
                accept
            label decline_job
                `The officer nods and rolls the chart closed. The offer will remain here if you change your mind.`
                close
    on accept
        log "Accepted A House Above the Reefs. Carry the convoy manifests to Clerk Mateo at Puerto Cielo and help him secure the archive."
    on visit
        conversation
            `Mateo finds orders for a chain boom across Cormorant Quay and a gun battery at the river mouth. The Company intends to stop every independent ship entering the region.`
    on complete
        conversation
            `A local shipwright says the boom can be disabled if the gunboats guarding it are removed.`
        log "Completed A House Above the Reefs. Received 570 gold. A local shipwright says the boom can be disabled if the gunboats guarding it are removed."
